{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":15,"ref":"2-kings 10:15","book":"2-kings","lang":"pcm","chapter":10,"translation":"And e bin go from dere, and e bin find ⟨את⟩ Yehonadab pikin of Rekhab, wey dey come meet am; and e bin bless am, and e bin talk to am: 'Plenti dey, ⟨be⟩ ⟨את⟩ yu heart straight as my heart dey wit yu heart?' And Yehonadab bin talk: 'Plenti dey.' ⟨E talk sey⟩ 'Gif ⟨את⟩ yu hand.' And e bin gif im hand, and e bin pull am up to am inside ⟨di⟩ chariot.","tokens":[{"surface":"וילך","gloss":"and e bin go"},{"surface":"משם","gloss":"from dere"},{"surface":"וימצא","gloss":"and e bin find"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"Yehonadab"},{"surface":"יהונדב","gloss":"Yehonadab"},{"surface":"בן","gloss":"pikin"},{"surface":"רכב","gloss":"of Rekhab"},{"surface":"לקראתו","gloss":"wey dey come meet am"},{"surface":"ויברכהו","gloss":"and e bin bless am"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"and e bin talk"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"to am"},{"surface":"היש","gloss":"plenti dey"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"yu heart"},{"surface":"לבבך","gloss":"yu heart"},{"surface":"ישר","gloss":"straight"},{"surface":"כאשר","gloss":"as"},{"surface":"לבבי","gloss":"my heart"},{"surface":"עם","gloss":"dey wit"},{"surface":"לבבך","gloss":"yu heart"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"and e bin talk"},{"surface":"יהונדב","gloss":"Yehonadab"},{"surface":"יש","gloss":"plenti dey"},{"surface":"ויש","gloss":"and plenti dey"},{"surface":"תנה","gloss":"gif"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"yu hand"},{"surface":"ידך","gloss":"yu hand"},{"surface":"ויתן","gloss":"and e bin gif"},{"surface":"ידו","gloss":"im hand"},{"surface":"ויעלהו","gloss":"and e bin pull am up"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"to am"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"inside"},{"surface":"המרכבה","gloss":"chariot"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-11T21:32:12.515230538Z","model":"glm-5.2"}